Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Engineering ingenuity has driven us to the cutting edge of a new industrial age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And AI infrastructure is accelerating the race with unprecedented speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:14.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pace isn't just increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.41,0:00:16.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's compounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,The scale has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.47,0:00:27.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The complexity has multiplied and the innovation isn't slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:32.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,To move at this speed, everything must be dialed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.08,0:00:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only bigger systems, but smarter ones, modular by design.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.85,0:00:47.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new approach to infrastructure, flexible where it matters, precise where it counts, built to scale from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.24,0:00:49.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This isn't a collection of systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a single machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,One continuous system moving at full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:01:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this isn't just theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:06.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is deployed and proven with clear momentum and a first-to-market track record.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Performance isn't added later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's engineered into every phase from the ground up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Super scale, micro focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.68,0:01:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every design optimized.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.32,0:01:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every component built for speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,When every layer is connected, when every system is dialed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.68,0:01:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,when everything is built to accelerate as one, acceleration isn't a feature.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.88,0:01:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Supermicro, built to accelerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:56.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, introducing Chairman, President, and CEO, Charles Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.48,0:01:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome everyone to our innovate at a Computex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:14.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very happy to see you all, especially here in Taipei, to our partners,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:20.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,our customers, and all our press friends from over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:24.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for joining us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The AI revolution has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:35.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyday we see many new AI applications and new adoptions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:43.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,to improve almost every aspect of our work and our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:52.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aggressive partners are coming to Supermicro and they all are asking us for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:03:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Help to develop system and solution that can accelerate their LLM,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,new cloud, enterprise AI, solving AI, or other AI applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,As AI revolution continues to grow everywhere, for every application, and looks never ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm super excited to share our latest experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,our new innovations, and our total solution with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:43.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most importantly, I want to invite you to grow at our speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.40,0:03:48.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,at our pace, or even much faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, in this incredible AI era, most of the are racing as fast as they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:04:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company, every country, every data center want to ride this AI wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, how can you best to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:10.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just do it, but best to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimize the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:18.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,If your data center infrastructure, for example, is delayed for 1 month,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 months, sometimes 6 months, you are losing massive opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we all know that time is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in lots of case, time is a much more than money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,How faster can your technology investment be online?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.68,0:04:45.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Online start to make a money and start to generate profitability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even just a few months or a quarter delay, your business may get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:05:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not just millions or even billion dollars of income loss, but the whole business opportunity may disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Simply put, every single day your system and your data center sitting idle is a direct hurt to your bottom line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why we are focusing so much to help you, our key partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to improve this one key metric, time to online, time to operation, time to make a money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The good news is a Supermicro can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:45.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at the this equation behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:51.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Time to market new technology, new product turn to market.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Plus time to deploy, not just send the product to your warehouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:06:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to your data center, but to deploy and make them plug and play online quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Time to online.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once online, then you can start to generate the profitability.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:21.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can ship new generation AI platform to you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Make your AI data center online faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.40,0:06:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about 3 months?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Faster sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much impact?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or 6 months ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can you work together to achieve that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:43.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is only a small fraction of our famous building block solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:51.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you can see, uh especially old partner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, Sugon might call have a most optimized system.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.93,0:06:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly optimized for your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:09.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because in most case, we are able to engineer new generation system quickly by leveraging some of our existing sub system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like some other board we can share, some enclosure, power supply, and so much sub system.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:24.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,The new system created by this building block don't just not just work fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.43,0:07:26.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fully optimized.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimized for performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimized for performance per dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,For energy efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And even for lower cost of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:39.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimization, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Based on our building block solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:52.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This building block DNA is why we are always the first to market since 33 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even now, we always have a faster time to market advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Optimize AI infrastructure quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:02.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over a past couple of years, Supermicro has successfully deployed the world's absolute largest AI data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We deliver this massive cutting-edge data center on timing
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,tighter timing line and achieve incredible tier one customer satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you, these customers are some of the most picky, most demanding technology operator in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:43.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,They demand perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:46.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,They demand extreme efficiency,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we deliver exactly what they need with close cooperation with our partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,vendor partner, and customer for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have built it our world's first gigawatt liquid cooling PLC AI data center in less than 5 months 2 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:17.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And recently, we just indeed finished another gigawatt data center in about 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, faster and faster because we leverage our experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,leverage our building block solution, leverage the our data center building block solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, for many long-term partner here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know that we have been one of our original server uh storage solution provider on the market since uh earlier 1990s.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:51.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, we don't chase the uh movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We we have been uh doing this for over 33 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.28,0:09:57.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Always time to market.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:10:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, we continue to have the broadest system level building block solution in the industry ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:17.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we have our X14 H14 uh portfolio in volume deployment since many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:27.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now we have a X15 uh Intel CPU-based H15 uh AMD uh processor-based and uh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:33.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,N15 Nvidia CPU-GPU-based solution and a new one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,A15 arm arm-based uh system and rack solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, all those uh ready for OEM order today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We also have those brand new arm HGI platform that I'm super excited about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:11:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are incredible platform for large cloud uh enterprise age compute and especially for authentic AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:08.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,With the highest uh core density, massive memory bandwidth,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,and flexible configuration, we will be able to ship them very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Either system level, rack level, or cluster level.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:29.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And look at right here on the stage, our massive uh accelerate GPU solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:32.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,We We one of the largest the of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:43.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,NVIDIA Blackwell GB300 GB300 B300 HGX a solution provider.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:52.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed in last 9 months last three quarter we ship more than 8,000 rack so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:58.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we ship also very high volume B300 HGX.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.07,0:12:09.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because as you know we are building block solution leader we always ship product to customer earlier than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:17.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are getting ready for the upcoming Vera Rubin MVL
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:23.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,72 indeed we already ship some sample to a certain customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:26.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so far their experience was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we are preparing for high volume production for you to to order today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:36.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then Rubin HGX right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:43.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rubin HGX we support eight node 64 GPU
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,or nine node or can be with another different
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:53.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,configuration kind of like this configuration uh we can
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:13:04.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,support 64 128 or 144 R200 system to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And sample is about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And production yes in next few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And also Vera CPU base right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:20.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rubin base and Vera base right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vera base you know CPU NVIDIA CPU base.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:29.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again kind of lots of different congregation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, already about simply now is is time to put it simple, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, force to come force to the service, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And for sure you are a force to the priority because you are our close partner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:50.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, So, all of those uh, not based optimization for a large AI or M,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh, infusing, uh, HPC and authentic AI, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.40,0:14:00.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, why is this module uh, all modularized design, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:06.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, building block solution approach uh, so critical, so good for the market,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, because uh, global IT uh, build out uh, changing very fast uh, as you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A data center and enterprise now uh, moving from uh, single high performance workload to more complex uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI AI or M, uh, so many AI, uh, infusing and uh, many kind of uh, AI applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:39.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, if you try to optimize your server and data center from scratch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:45.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will run into a uh, massive of engineering bottleneck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And those are uh, time to market delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:55.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why based on modularized uh, building block solution, direct scale plug and play, that's the best way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:15:00.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Supermicro, as you know, we are the expert uh, for those uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:08.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh, approach for 20 years, more than 20 years, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh, and more importantly, I mean uh, uh, how quickly can you deploy them um, other than make a product available, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.53,0:15:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And how can we uh, have a high volume deploy for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:24.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this putting us to a time to deploy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:35.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the old day, deploy uh data center mean uh receive thousand of box.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:38.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you unbox them and integrate to a rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:43.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then uh testing everything uh in data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:44.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And cabling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:47.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then uh kind of uh take a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.95,0:15:49.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Try and yellow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, now instead, we ship you in a kind of computer rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.33,0:15:57.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything is pretty test.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:58.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pretty validated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.69,0:16:02.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, when we ship to your data center, it's ready to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,A true plug and play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.92,0:16:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have some customer say, "Hey, they buy uh from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,They plug and cannot play."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:16.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,They plug and have to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And another fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:18.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally play.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:20.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:20.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, uh we have been working together for many years, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our plug and play uh is pretty much true plug and play.
