Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.88,0:47:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.32,0:47:03.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.92,0:47:04.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.24,0:47:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.32,0:47:11.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, that's the how Supermicro building block solution advantage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.23,0:47:18.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a building block solution for board level, for system level, for rack level, for data center level.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.10,0:47:26.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And again, our management software, our switch all support the all our Nvidia chip, all our AMD chip, all our ARM chip.
